{"4888520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixel Three Kingdoms: Zombie Dungeon", "steam_appid": 4888520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4896220], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pixel Three Kingdoms - Zombie Dungeon&quot; combines various random elements such as dungeons, exploration, auto-chess, hero and equipment draws. Choose a hero as the lord to assemble your army lineup, and all gameplay elements are generated by the program in the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Maze exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring various procedurally generated dungeons, you can discover treasure chests, destructible objects, and various NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the search process, assemble your own heroic army and purchase equipment for them to gain stronger abilities and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you must constantly move, otherwise you may be unable to parry the enemy's attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/66bce738bc229b2329a314f6d1fb9956.poster.avif?t=1785829054\" width=458 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/66bce738bc229b2329a314f6d1fb9956.webm?t=1785829054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/66bce738bc229b2329a314f6d1fb9956.mp4?t=1785829054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 1: Enter the dungeon and continuously explore and gather resources, defeating the zombies on each level to advance to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 2: You will protect a lord until the end, withstanding the frenzied onslaught of zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 3: Eliminate the traitors. You will encounter heroes who once fought alongside you and zombies who have become allies, and you must eliminate them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Auto Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your followers will fight on their own. You need to assemble a team, decide where to explore, when to proceed, and choose the right upgrade options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/6f3a4ffcbde3d203c4e1f3a801623133.poster.avif?t=1785829054\" width=458 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/6f3a4ffcbde3d203c4e1f3a801623133.webm?t=1785829054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/6f3a4ffcbde3d203c4e1f3a801623133.mp4?t=1785829054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Powerful construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout each game session, you have the opportunity to purchase various units and assemble your team. Each unit possesses unique special abilities, enabling you to create a team with powerful synergistic effects. Purchasing multiple units of the same type will eventually unlock exclusive special abilities. Make clever use of resources and strategically refresh units and loot to precisely acquire the build you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/64e30d83d92aa0a3715809b64e814f55.avif?t=1785829054\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/f96cdd590b0e0d3e26cf3099998db661.avif?t=1785829054\" width=1278 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/792b0f0a2f432dd4b7b233f3e0d7fea8.avif?t=1785829054\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Growth outside the circle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the battle, you will receive experience and ingots. The experience will be used to level up the currently selected hero, while the ingots can be used to unlock more selectable heroes and upgrade any hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the hero who grows and makes the next game easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program-generated dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time automatic combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many levels, with various types of enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters have their own special abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple units, unlockable special abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large quantity of powerful spoils of war</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful special effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various gameplay strategies require creative construction to overcome challenges</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pixel Three Kingdoms - Zombie Dungeon&quot; combines various random elements such as dungeons, exploration, auto-chess, hero and equipment draws. Choose a hero as the lord to assemble your army lineup, and all gameplay elements are generated by the program in the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Maze exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring various procedurally generated dungeons, you can discover treasure chests, destructible objects, and various NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the search process, assemble your own heroic army and purchase equipment for them to gain stronger abilities and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you must constantly move, otherwise you may be unable to parry the enemy's attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/66bce738bc229b2329a314f6d1fb9956.poster.avif?t=1785829054\" width=458 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/66bce738bc229b2329a314f6d1fb9956.webm?t=1785829054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888520/extras/66bce738bc229b2329a314f6d1fb9956.mp4?t=1785829054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 1: Enter the dungeon and continuously explore and gather resources, defeating the zombies on each level to advance to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 2: You will protect a lord until the end, withstanding the frenzied onslaught of zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay 3: Eliminate the traitors. You will encounter heroes who once fought alongside you and zombies who have become allies, and you must eliminate them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">